#: /home/cursor/zephyr/zfr/src/zfr_lib/lint/__init__.py:113
msgid ""
"Check the current zephyr project for missing files and packaging/style "
"mistakes. Walks from cwd toward parent directories. CSR colors when stdout "
"is a TTY. Style-contract blurbs default on for non-interactive stdout and AI-"
"integrated terminals (Cursor, VS Code, Windsurf, …); off for a plain "
"interactive shell. Override with -i/-I."
msgstr ""
"检查当前 zephyr 项目的缺失文件与打包/风格问题；从 cwd 向父目录遍历。stdout "
"为 TTY 时使用 CSR 颜色。风格约定说明块默认对非交互输出与 AI 终端（Cursor、VS "
"Code、Windsurf 等）开启，普通交互式 shell 关闭。可用 -i/-I 覆盖。"

#: /home/cursor/zephyr/zfr/src/zfr_lib/lint/__init__.py:139
msgid ""
"show zephyr style-contract / next-steps blurbs (default for pipes and AI "
"terminals)"
msgstr "显示 zephyr 风格约定/后续步骤说明（管道与 AI 终端默认开启）"

#: /home/cursor/zephyr/zfr/src/zfr_lib/lint/__init__.py:146
msgid ""
"hide zephyr style-contract / next-steps blurbs (default for plain "
"interactive shell)"
msgstr "隐藏 zephyr 风格约定/后续步骤说明（普通交互式 shell 默认关闭）"

